*.env*
/certs/*
.DS_Store
!env.podman-sample
!env.sample
# Terraform rules live in terraform/.gitignore so they sit next to what they
# cover. The rules that used to be here are superseded by it, with two fixes:
#   - `*.tfsvars` was a typo for `*.tfvars`, so it matched nothing — which is
#     how terraform/minikube/terraform.tfvars came to be committed with
#     credentials in it.
#   - provider lock files are no longer ignored; Terraform expects
#     .terraform.lock.hcl to be committed so provider versions are reproducible.